'''Whippers''' are fiendish enemies added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''.

They wield long fleshy whip-like tendrils, which they use for a short-range melee attack. They wander around the room in straight lines and charge at Isaac if he lines up with them, during which they open their mouths wide. If Isaac gets too close, they will slash their whips at him, causing damage and deflecting nearby tears. Whippers will also whip at placed {{e|Bomb}}s.

In {{s|Gehenna}}, their appearance changes to resemble a bondage suit.
{{clear}}

== Snapper ==
{{infobox monster
